    "codex 超过 %lld 秒没有返回，已经把它停掉了。可以换个更小的模型，或者先在终端直接跑一次 codex 确认它是通的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex returned nothing for %lld seconds and was stopped. Try a smaller model, or run codex directly in a terminal first to confirm it works."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "codex 超过 %lld 秒没有返回，已经把它停掉了。可以换个更小的模型，或者先在终端直接跑一次 codex 确认它是通的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」在排除列表中，本次不读取截图与页面文字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is on the exclusion list, so no screenshot or page text was read."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」在排除列表中，本次不读取截图与页面文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」是最久没更新的那个，它会被永久删除，无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is the least recently updated one. It will be permanently deleted and cannot be recovered."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」是最久没更新的那个，它会被永久删除，无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」的全部消息会从本机删除，无法撤销，也没有回收站。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every message in “%@” will be deleted from this Mac. There is no undo and no trash."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的全部消息会从本机删除，无法撤销，也没有回收站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "【上一轮你的回答】\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[Your previous answer]\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
