          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "【用户】\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上下文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Context"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上下文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次的对话记录读不出来了，已经原样备份成 %@，当前列表是空的。备份文件在 Wisp 的应用支持目录里，没有被删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previous conversation file could not be read. It was backed up unchanged as %@ and the list is now empty. The backup is still in Wisp's application-support folder — nothing was deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次的对话记录读不出来了，已经原样备份成 %@，当前列表是空的。备份文件在 Wisp 的应用支持目录里，没有被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limits"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不花钱 · 100 万上下文 · 免费里最强，但也最容易被占满。付费版 $1.000/百万": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free · 1M context · the strongest free option, and the one most often saturated. Paid tier is $1.000 per million"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不花钱 · 100 万上下文 · 免费里最强，但也最容易被占满。付费版 $1.000/百万"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不花钱 · 100 万上下文 · 免费首选。付费版 $0.300/百万，说明底子不弱": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free · 1M context · the free pick. Its paid tier runs $0.300 per million, which says something about the model underneath"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不花钱 · 100 万上下文 · 免费首选。付费版 $0.300/百万，说明底子不弱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不选的话就跟随系统语言。这个设置只影响 Wisp 自己，不动系统设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Left alone, Wisp follows your system language. This setting affects Wisp only and changes nothing system-wide."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不选的话就跟随系统语言。这个设置只影响 Wisp 自己，不动系统设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端接口": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud Endpoint"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云端接口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshot only"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "任何 OpenAI 兼容接口，自带 Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, your own key"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何 OpenAI 兼容接口，自带 Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会删除对话文件、调试文件和钥匙串里的 Key。系统的 Time Machine 备份和模型供应商那边的请求日志不在本应用控制范围内。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes the conversation file, the debug files, and the key in your Keychain. Time Machine backups and your model provider's request logs are outside Wisp's control."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会删除对话文件、调试文件和钥匙串里的 Key。系统的 Time Machine 备份和模型供应商那边的请求日志不在本应用控制范围内。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Position"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你去看别的窗口以后才开始倒计时。面板有焦点、鼠标停在上面、或者回答正在生成，都不会收起。收起只是把面板收回小药丸，对话不会丢。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The countdown only starts once you look at another window. It never collapses while the panel has focus, your pointer is over it, or an answer is streaming. Collapsing just tucks the panel back into the island — no conversation is lost."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你去看别的窗口以后才开始倒计时。面板有焦点、鼠标停在上面、或者回答正在生成，都不会收起。收起只是把面板收回小药丸，对话不会丢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "便宜，40 万上下文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cheap, 400K context"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "便宜，40 万上下文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存并测试连接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save and test connection"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存并测试连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "信息": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Info"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只发当前窗口截图和网址。不读页面，最快。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends the current window and URL only. Fastest."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只发当前窗口截图和网址。不读页面，最快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读取页面正文。动态页面可能只包含当前可见内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads page text. Dynamic pages may include visible content only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取页面正文。动态页面可能只包含当前可见内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "滚动动态页面后回到原位。需要辅助功能权限。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scrolls dynamic pages, then returns to your position. Requires Accessibility."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "滚动动态页面后回到原位。需要辅助功能权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机运行、无需联网；请选择支持图片输入的模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs locally with no network; choose a model that accepts images."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机运行、无需联网；请选择支持图片输入的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用已登录的 Codex，无需 API Key；回答一次性返回。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your signed-in Codex; no API Key needed, and replies arrive at once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用已登录的 Codex，无需 API Key；回答一次性返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 测试只检查能否启动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Codex test only checks startup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex 测试只检查能否启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送一张 64×64 测试图，验证连接和图片输入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sends a 64×64 test image to verify the connection and image input."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送一张 64×64 测试图，验证连接和图片输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "底部位置可拖动，Wisp 会记住位置；面板仍从底部中央打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the desktop island; Wisp remembers its position. The panel still opens from bottom center."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "底部位置可拖动，Wisp 会记住位置；面板仍从底部中央打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "空闲时只显示图标；悬停展开，点击打开。回答生成时可停止。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Idle shows an icon; hover to expand and click to open. Stop while generating."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空闲时只显示图标；悬停展开，点击打开。回答生成时可停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "离开面板后开始倒计时；输入、悬停、生成或采集时不会收起。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starts after leaving the panel; stays open while focused, hovered, generating, or capturing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离开面板后开始倒计时；输入、悬停、生成或采集时不会收起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整页文字需要浏览器的 Apple Events 权限；在浏览器的 Developer 菜单中开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full-page text requires browser Apple Events access. Enable it from the browser's Developer menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整页文字需要浏览器的 Apple Events 权限；在浏览器的 Developer 菜单中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个 Chromium 配置文件都要单独开启；未开启时仍可读网址和截图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable it once per Chromium profile. Without it, Wisp still reads the URL and screenshot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个 Chromium 配置文件都要单独开启；未开启时仍可读网址和截图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要辅助功能权限才能滑动采集。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility permission is required for scroll collection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要辅助功能权限才能滑动采集。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "超出上限时保留开头和结尾，并标记省略。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Over the limit, Wisp keeps the beginning and end and marks the omission."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超出上限时保留开头和结尾，并标记省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排除后不截图，也不读取浏览器页面。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Excluded apps are not captured or read."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "排除后不截图，也不读取浏览器页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到上限时，新建对话会询问是否移除最久未更新的一项。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the limit, creating a conversation asks before removing the least recently updated one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到上限时，新建对话会询问是否移除最久未更新的一项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只保存对话和页面文字快照；截图不会写入磁盘。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only conversations and page-text snapshots are stored; screenshots never touch disk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只保存对话和页面文字快照；截图不会写入磁盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "额外写入 last-context.json 和 last-screenshot.jpg，仅用于排查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writes last-context.json and last-screenshot.jpg for diagnostics only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "额外写入 last-context.json 和 last-screenshot.jpg，仅用于排查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除对话、调试文件和钥匙串中的 API Key；不可撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes conversations, debug files, and the API Key in Keychain. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除对话、调试文件和钥匙串中的 API Key；不可撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "留空跟随系统；只影响 Wisp，不改系统语言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave it as system; this affects Wisp only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "留空跟随系统；只影响 Wisp，不改系统语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅请求 GitHub 的版本号，不发送使用信息，也不会自动下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks only GitHub for the version number; sends no usage info and never downloads automatically."
          }
