    },
    "只保存对话文字与页面文字快照。截图从不写入硬盘。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only conversation text and page-text snapshots are stored. Screenshots are never written to disk."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只保存对话文字与页面文字快照。截图从不写入硬盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只向 GitHub 请求一次最新版本号，不发送任何关于你或你使用情况的信息，也不会自动下载或安装。关掉之后就完全不联网检查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This asks GitHub once for the latest version number. It sends nothing about you or how you use Wisp, and never downloads or installs anything on its own. Turn it off and no check is made at all."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只向 GitHub 请求一次最新版本号，不发送任何关于你或你使用情况的信息，也不会自动下载或安装。关掉之后就完全不联网检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只回答问题本身，不要执行任何命令，不要读写文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
