            "value": "复制回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复用你已经登录的 Codex，不用另配 API Key。以只读沙箱运行，不落会话文件。两点要知道：它每次都会带上约两万 token 的固定上下文，走的是你的 Codex 额度；而且没有逐字流式，回答会一次性出现。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reuses the Codex you are already signed in to, so no separate API key is needed. It runs in a read-only sandbox and leaves no session files behind. Two things to know: every request carries roughly twenty thousand tokens of fixed context against your Codex quota, and there is no token-by-token streaming — the answer arrives all at once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复用你已经登录的 Codex，不用另配 API Key。以只读沙箱运行，不落会话文件。两点要知道：它每次都会带上约两万 token 的固定上下文，走的是你的 Codex 额度；而且没有逐字流式，回答会一次性出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复用已登录的 Codex，免配 Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
