    "问点什么…  Return 发送，Shift+Return 换行": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask something…  Return to send, Shift+Return for a new line"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问点什么…  Return 发送，Shift+Return 换行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问点关于当前屏幕的事": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask about what's on screen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问点关于当前屏幕的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "闲置时只有一颗图标大小，鼠标移上去才展开成一条，点一下打开助手。生成回答时会变宽并给出停止键。它只跟踪当前是哪个应用，不截图也不读页面。主面板打开时它会自动收起。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Idle it is just an icon; hover to expand it into a bar, click to open the assistant. While an answer streams it widens and offers a stop button. It only tracks which app is frontmost — it never captures the screen or reads pages. It hides itself while the main panel is open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "闲置时只有一颗图标大小，鼠标移上去才展开成一条，点一下打开助手。生成回答时会变宽并给出停止键。它只跟踪当前是哪个应用，不截图也不读页面。主面板打开时它会自动收起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "附件里是当前屏幕的截图，请结合它回答。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The attachment is a screenshot of the current screen. Take it into account when answering."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附件里是当前屏幕的截图，请结合它回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隐藏上下文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide context"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏上下文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "页面含 %lld 个跨域嵌入框架，其内部文字读不到，只能靠截图判断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The page contains %lld cross-origin embedded frames whose text cannot be read — judge those from the screenshot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "页面含 %lld 个跨域嵌入框架，其内部文字读不到，只能靠截图判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "页面文字上限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Page text limit"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "页面文字上限"
          }
        }
      }
