            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智谱 GLM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个 Key 通到各家模型，带若干免费模型。免费模型限流严，付费模型更稳。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One key reaches models from every vendor, free ones included. Free models are rate-limited hard; paid ones are steadier."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个 Key 通到各家模型，带若干免费模型。免费模型限流严，付费模型更稳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flash 和 Flash-Lite 有免费额度，不用绑卡；Pro 系列只能付费用。截图场景性价比最高。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flash and Flash-Lite have a free tier and need no card; Pro is paid only. Best value for screenshot work."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flash 和 Flash-Lite 有免费额度，不用绑卡；Pro 系列只能付费用。截图场景性价比最高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GPT-5.6 三档全系支持图片输入，按量计费，没有免费额度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All three GPT-5.6 tiers accept image input. Pay as you go; there is no free tier."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GPT-5.6 三档全系支持图片输入，按量计费，没有免费额度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "走 Anthropic 的 OpenAI 兼容层。图片输入官方标注完全支持，但这层的官方定位是「测试和对比模型能力」，不承诺长期生产可用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Goes through Anthropic's OpenAI compatibility layer. Image input is documented as fully supported, but Anthropic positions this layer for testing and comparing models, not for long-term production."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "走 Anthropic 的 OpenAI 兼容层。图片输入官方标注完全支持，但这层的官方定位是「测试和对比模型能力」，不承诺长期生产可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "国内可直连。GLM-4.6V Flash 免费，GLM-5.3-Flash 是原生多模态、100 万上下文。": {
