            "value": "agy did not respond within %lld seconds and was stopped. Try a smaller model, or run agy directly in Terminal first to confirm it works."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "agy 超过 %lld 秒没有返回，已经把它停掉了。可以换个更小的模型，或先在终端直接跑一次 agy 确认它是通的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "跟随 Agy 默认": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow Agy's default"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随 Agy 默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每次扫描都会直接执行 agy models，不缓存版本或模型列表；Agy 更新后重新扫描即可。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each scan runs agy models directly instead of caching the version or model list; scan again after Agy updates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次扫描都会直接执行 agy models，不缓存版本或模型列表；Agy 更新后重新扫描即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地 Cli 测试只检查当前选中的命令能否启动，不会为了测试额外消耗模型额度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local Cli test only checks whether the selected command starts; it does not spend an extra model request."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地 Cli 测试只检查当前选中的命令能否启动，不会为了测试额外消耗模型额度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下面这些文件是当前屏幕的截图，请先读取它们，再结合看到的内容回答：\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The files below are screenshots of the current screen. Read them first, then answer using what they show:\n%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下面这些文件是当前屏幕的截图，请先读取它们，再结合看到的内容回答：\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只回答问题本身。除了上面列出的截图文件，不要读写任何其它文件，也不要执行别的命令。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answer the question itself. Apart from the screenshot files listed above, do not read or write any other file and do not run any other command."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只回答问题本身。除了上面列出的截图文件，不要读写任何其它文件，也不要执行别的命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用已登录的 Agy，不需要单独填写 API Key；有截图时会先写进临时目录，再交给 Agy 读取，用完即删。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses your signed-in Agy; no separate API Key is needed. Screenshots are written to a temporary directory for Agy to read, and removed as soon as the request ends."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用已登录的 Agy，不需要单独填写 API Key；有截图时会先写进临时目录，再交给 Agy 读取，用完即删。"
          }
