    "重新读取屏幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-read screen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新读取屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启截图附带": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attach screenshots"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启截图附带"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭截图附带": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop attaching screenshots"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭截图附带"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请梳理当前窗口呈现的核心内容，帮我快速把握重点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarize what this window is showing so I can get the gist quickly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请梳理当前窗口呈现的核心内容，帮我快速把握重点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从当前屏幕中提取重要信息，整理成清晰的要点与待办事项。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pull the important information off this screen into clear takeaways and to-dos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从当前屏幕中提取重要信息，整理成清晰的要点与待办事项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "屏幕共享": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screen sharing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕共享"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尝试在屏幕共享时隐藏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try to hide during screen sharing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试在屏幕共享时隐藏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尝试在共享和录屏中隐藏 Wisp": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try to hide Wisp from sharing and recording"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试在共享和录屏中隐藏 Wisp"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在兼容的共享和录屏方式中隐藏窗口，本机照常使用。效果取决于系统和录屏方式，请先检查接收端画面；开启不代表已经隐藏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests window hiding in compatible capture paths while keeping Wisp usable locally. Results depend on macOS and the recorder. Check the receiving side first; enabled does not mean verified hidden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在兼容的共享和录屏方式中隐藏窗口，本机照常使用。效果取决于系统和录屏方式，请先检查接收端画面；开启不代表已经隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wisp 会和普通窗口一样出现在共享画面和录屏里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wisp appears in shared screens and recordings like any other window."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wisp 会和普通窗口一样出现在共享画面和录屏里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "录制 Wisp 演示时请关闭。菜单栏图标、系统弹窗和窗口列表不保证隐藏；摄像机拍屏与硬件采集不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn this off to record Wisp demos. Menu bar icons, system dialogs, and window lists are not guaranteed hidden. Cameras and hardware capture are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录制 Wisp 演示时请关闭。菜单栏图标、系统弹窗和窗口列表不保证隐藏；摄像机拍屏与硬件采集不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在菜单栏显示图标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show icon in the menu bar"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在菜单栏显示图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "菜单栏图标由系统绘制，隐藏开关对它无效，录屏和共享里一定看得见。关掉它，菜单栏上就不留痕迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The menu bar icon is drawn by the system, so the hiding preference cannot apply to it and every recording or shared screen includes it. Turn it off to leave nothing in the menu bar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏图标由系统绘制，隐藏开关对它无效，录屏和共享里一定看得见。关掉它，菜单栏上就不留痕迹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "菜单栏没有 Wisp 图标。用全局快捷键唤起面板，面板右上角的齿轮可以回到这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Wisp icon in the menu bar. Use the global shortcut to open the panel; the gear in the panel header brings you back here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单栏没有 Wisp 图标。用全局快捷键唤起面板，面板右上角的齿轮可以回到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置（菜单栏图标已隐藏）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings (menu bar icon hidden)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置（菜单栏图标已隐藏）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "远端接口必须使用 HTTPS；HTTP 仅允许 localhost、127.0.0.1 或 ::1。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remote endpoints must use HTTPS; HTTP is accepted only for localhost, 127.0.0.1, or ::1."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远端接口必须使用 HTTPS；HTTP 仅允许 localhost、127.0.0.1 或 ::1。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面板不透明度": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Panel opacity"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "面板不透明度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "调低后能看穿到底下的窗口，方便对照着提问。只有面板底会变透，文字和按钮始终清晰。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lower it to see the window underneath while you ask about it. Only the panel background fades; text and buttons stay sharp."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调低后能看穿到底下的窗口，方便对照着提问。只有面板底会变透，文字和按钮始终清晰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "悬停或输入时恢复不透明": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go opaque while hovered or focused"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "悬停或输入时恢复不透明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "文字和按钮不受影响，始终是实心的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text and buttons stay solid."
