            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在保存末尾文字…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在点击请求时弹出系统授权；打开此页不会开始录音。系统采集指示无法由 Wisp 的状态点替代。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This page requests permission only when you click Request. Opening it does not record. Wisp’s status dot cannot replace system privacy indicators."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在点击请求时弹出系统授权；打开此页不会开始录音。系统采集指示无法由 Wisp 的状态点替代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击刷新以授权并列出应用；浏览器会采集该应用的音频，不能只选一个标签页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Click refresh to authorize and list apps. Browser audio is captured per app, not per tab."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击刷新以授权并列出应用；浏览器会采集该应用的音频，不能只选一个标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在录音，打开实时字幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording, open live captions"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在录音，打开实时字幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "转写取上一次交出去之后说的全部内容，最多 12,000 字。「放入输入框」不会自动发送；两个「分析」会连同当前上下文一起发送给所选模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A transfer covers everything said since the last one, up to 12,000 characters. Add to draft never sends; both Analyze actions send it, with the current context, to the selected model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写取上一次交出去之后说的全部内容，最多 12,000 字。「放入输入框」不会自动发送；两个「分析」会连同当前上下文一起发送给所选模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在设置 → 音频中选择应用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose an app in Settings → Audio."
          }
        }
      }
