    "录音记录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listening records"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设备端转写，文字自动保存在本机。录制前请取得必要同意；系统仍会显示采集提示。双方模式建议戴耳机，避免重复收音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription stays on-device and text is saved locally. Obtain necessary consent before recording; system capture indicators remain visible. Use headphones in both-sides mode to avoid duplicate audio."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备端转写，文字自动保存在本机。录制前请取得必要同意；系统仍会显示采集提示。双方模式建议戴耳机，避免重复收音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "转写积压过多，已停止录音。请关闭其他高负载应用后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
